every teenager right now.

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:12.380
It's all about making,
watching, and sharing

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:16.460
15 to 60 second videos, most with music.

00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:19.010
Open the app and you're
in the for you feed.

00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:20.710
This is an endless feed of videos

00:01:20.710 --> 00:01:22.490
