00:01:22.490 --> 00:01:25.410
Keep swiping up and you
get more and more and more

00:01:25.410 --> 00:01:27.980
and more and more and
more and more videos.

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:29.910
It's incredibly easy
to make your own video

00:01:29.910 --> 00:01:31.340
and add music to it.

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:35.250
That means so many dancing
and lip-syncing videos.

00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:38.090
But TikTok is much more than that now.

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:40.120
Memes are central to TikTok

00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:43.730
and I blame them for why I got
completely hooked on the app.

00:01:43.730 --> 00:01:46.800
A meme is really anything
that spreads on the internet

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:49.520
and that is iterated on or re-interpreted.

00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:53.100
On TikTok, a meme can be
a song, a dance, a filter,

00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:55.990
even a hashtag that lots
of people start to post.

00:01:55.990 --> 00:01:57.900
But I just had to find out.

00:01:57.900 --> 00:02:00.320
How do you make a viral TikTok?

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:01.908
