Or what the kids call a--

00:02:01.908 --> 00:02:03.620
- Be a banger on TikTok.

00:02:03.620 --> 00:02:05.200
- Absolutely sheer bangers.

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:08.290
- Bangers, in my opinion, because they got

00:02:08.290 --> 00:02:10.230
millions of views and yeah.

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:12.390
- A banger is like...

00:02:13.884 --> 00:02:14.717
It's like--

00:02:14.717 --> 00:02:15.550
- It's like a hit.
- Yeah, like.

00:02:15.550 --> 00:02:17.440
- Yo, that's fire, that's a banger.

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:18.558
- That's a banger, yeah, like.

00:02:18.558 --> 00:02:19.391
- [Joanna Voiceover] Just learning

00:02:19.391 --> 00:02:20.970
what a banger was wasn't enough.

00:02:20.970 --> 00:02:23.319
I needed to learn how to make one.

00:02:23.319 --> 00:02:26.280
- See what's trending, like you want to go

00:02:26.280 --> 00:02:28.770
to the for you page, you want to look at

00:02:28.770 --> 00:02:32.470
what everyone is doing and
see what's popping, what's in.

00:02:32.470 --> 00:02:36.430
- Honestly, I think that
the more relatable it is,

00:02:36.430 --> 00:02:37.963
the better it is because,

00:02:38.890 --> 00:02:40.460
yeah, I just think if people relate to it,

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:41.630
they're gonna love it,
they're just gonna eat it up.

00:02:41.630 --> 00:02:43.100
- It's the simple stuff that go viral.

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:46.500
It's more about what caption you put.

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:48.040
The video could be trash,

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:50.940
if your caption's good,
the video's good (laughs).

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:53.840
- So with that, I set out to
make som TikToks of my own

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:55.960
by joining a couple of different memes.

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:58.460
So a thing I think is very funny on TikTok

00:02:58.460 --> 00:03:03.430
